{
	title: 'Status lines hide windows a full window outlasts',
	spec: "A usage window is moot when another window of the same account is at 100% and resets no earlier (a full 7d makes the 5h moot; a full 5h resetting before the 7d does not). The web and terminal status lines leave moot windows out entirely, and the web model name's quota fill uses the remaining (binding) window, so a full 7d shows 0% left. usageWindows.moot holds the rule for every client.",
